{"pk": "807", "sid": "1623898", "name": "Sindrup1992", "licence": "open", "access": "public", "date": "2025-10-07", "group_count": 1, "individual_count": 144, "intervention_count": 3, "output_count": 164, "output_calculated_count": 9, "subset_count": 3, "timecourse_count": 3, "scatter_count": 0, "reference": {"pk": 811, "study": {"sid": "1623898", "name": "Sindrup1992"}, "pmid": "1623898", "sid": "1623898", "name": "Sindrup1992", "doi": null, "title": "The effect of quinidine on the analgesic effect of codeine.", "abstract": "We have studied the hypoalgesic effect of codeine (100 mg) after blocking the hepatic O-demethylation of codeine to morphine via the sparteine oxygenase (CYP2D6) by quinidine (200 mg). The study was performed in 16 extensive metabolizers of sparteine, using a double-blind, randomized, four-way, cross-over design. The treatments given at 3 h intervals during the four sessions were placebo/placebo, quinidine/placebo, placebo/codeine, and quinidine/codeine. We measured pinprick pain and pain tolerance thresholds to high energy argon laser stimuli before and 1, 2, and 3 h after codeine or placebo. After codeine and placebo, the peak plasma concentration of morphine was 6-62 (median 18) nmol.l-1. When quinidine pre-treatment was given, no morphine could be detected (less than 4 nmol.l-1) after codeine. The pin-prick pain thresholds were significantly increased after placebo/codeine, but not after quinidine/codeine compared with placebo/placebo. Both placebo/codeine and quinidine/codeine increased pain tolerance thresholds significantly. Quinidine/codeine and quinidine/placebo did not differ significantly for either pin-prick or tolerance pain thresholds. These results are compatible with local CYP2D6 mediated formation of morphine in the brain, not being blocked by quinidine. Alternatively, a hypoalgesic effect of quinidine might have confounded the results.", "journal": "European journal of clinical pharmacology", "date": "1992-08-10", "authors": [{"pk": 4765, "first_name": "S H", "last_name": "Sindrup"}, {"pk": 4766, "first_name": "L", "last_name": "Arendt-Nielsen"}, {"pk": 4767, "first_name": "K", "last_name": "Br\u00f8sen"}, {"pk": 4768, "first_name": "P", "last_name": "Bjerring"}, {"pk": 4769, "first_name": "H R", "last_name": "Angelo"}, {"pk": 4770, "first_name": "B", "last_name": "Eriksen"}, {"pk": 4771, "first_name": "L F", "last_name": "Gram"}]}, "reference_date": "1992-08-10", "creator": {"username": "janekg", "first_name": "Jan", "last_name": "Grzegorzewski"}, "curators": [{"rating": 0.0, "username": "janekg", "first_name": "Jan", "last_name": "Grzegorzewski"}], "collaborators": [], "comments": [], "descriptions": [], "files": [{"pk": 9986, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Fig2A.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Fig2A.tsv"}, {"pk": 9991, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Fig2B.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Fig2B.tsv"}, {"pk": 9989, "name": "data/Sindrup1992_Fig2.png", "file": "/media/data/Sindrup1992_Fig2.png"}, {"pk": 9987, "name": "data/Sindrup1992.pdf", "file": "/media/data/Sindrup1992.pdf"}, {"pk": 9985, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1A.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1A.tsv"}, {"pk": 9988, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1B.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1B.tsv"}, {"pk": 9993, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Tab1.tsv"}, {"pk": 9990, "name": "data/.Sindrup1992_Tab2.tsv", "file": "/media/data/.Sindrup1992_Tab2.tsv"}, {"pk": 9992, "name": "data/Sindrup1992.xlsx", "file": "/media/data/Sindrup1992.xlsx"}], "substances": [{"sid": "cod", "name": "codeine", "label": "codeine"}, {"sid": "mor", "name": "morphine", "label": "morphine"}, {"sid": "qui", "name": "quinidine", "label": "quinidine"}, {"sid": "sparteine", "name": "sparteine", "label": "sparteine"}, {"sid": "sparteine-sulfate", "name": "sparteine sulfate", "label": "sparteine sulfate"}, {"sid": "2hspar", "name": "2-dehydrosparteine", "label": "2-dehydrosparteine"}, {"sid": "5hspar", 